我正在喝杯咖啡。

13
00:00:34.930 --> 00:00:35.810
Hi, guys!
嘿，大家好！

14
00:00:36.610 --> 00:00:45.710
Today, we are talking about Two Weeks, which is Season 5, Episode 21, written by Aaron Schur and directed by Paul Lieberstein.
今天，我们要聊的是《两周》，即第五季第21集，由亚伦·舒尔编剧，保罗·利伯斯坦执导。

15
00:00:46.110 --> 00:00:51.470
