In place of Dunder Mifflin.
代替了邓德·米夫林。

842
00:35:48.530 --> 00:35:48.710
Right.
没错。

843
00:35:49.310 --> 00:35:51.850
She's like, okay, all right, let me think about this.
她说，好吧，行，让我考虑一下。

844
00:35:51.930 --> 00:35:54.610
