882
00:37:22.730 --> 00:37:23.610
He was like, come on in.
他当时就像是，进来吧。

883
00:37:23.830 --> 00:37:26.270
I felt like this was super animated, Angela.
我觉得这段安吉拉表现得超级活跃。

884
00:37:27.150 --> 00:37:32.930
Well, you know, she is turning on the charm for Mr. Charles Minor.
嗯，你知道，她正在对查尔斯·迈纳先生施展魅力。

