Idris Elba played on the writers before he came to set.
是伊德里斯·艾尔巴在来片场之前对编剧们做的。

894
00:38:05.830 --> 00:38:05.990
Yeah.
是啊。

895
00:38:05.990 --> 00:38:12.030
Now, he actually said, I don't know if this was a prank that Mindy played on us, pretending
现在，他其实说，我不知道这是敏迪对我们开的恶作剧，假装

