that it was from Idris or if it was actually from Idris.
是伊德里斯发的，还是真的是伊德里斯发的。

897
00:38:15.230 --> 00:38:23.750
But I guess they got this email that was like, listen, Idris gets really upset if you mispronounce
但我猜他们收到了一封邮件，大意是，听着，如果你们读错了伊德里斯的名字，

