00:39:19.890 --> 00:39:21.170
With two gals who love to Google.
我们是两个爱用谷歌搜索的女孩。

923
00:39:21.630 --> 00:39:22.510
We're here for you.
我们随时为你准备着。

924
00:39:23.070 --> 00:39:25.590
Well, Charles has a talking head where he just kind of owns it.
查尔斯有个访谈镜头，他表现得非常自信。

925
00:39:25.590 --> 00:39:28.770
He's like, look, I know the effect I have on women.
他说，听着，我知道我对女性的影响力。

926
00:39:29.390 --> 00:39:30.190
That's a meme.
那是个梗。

927
00:39:30.770 --> 00:39:31.210
Yeah.
没错。

928
00:39:31.470 --> 00:39:32.310
It's so funny.
太搞笑了。

929
00:39:32.970 --> 00:39:37.190
Well, Aaron Schur shared with us, you guys, that that talking head was inspired from a
亚伦·舒尔告诉我们，那个访谈镜头灵感来源于他的一次

