I would save the receptioniSt.
我会拯救那位前台。

1361
00:59:02.600 --> 00:59:03.000
Hmm.
嗯。

1362
00:59:03.820 --> 00:59:04.180
Yeah.
是啊。

1363
00:59:04.440 --> 00:59:07.220
Well, listen, there were a lot of other receptionists that come along,
听着，后来还有很多其他的前台出现，

1364
