Oh, gosh.
天哪。

1378
00:59:32.060 --> 00:59:33.260
Don't bring that either.
那个也别带。

1379
00:59:34.060 --> 00:59:38.980
Listen, thank you so much to Aaron Schur and Randy Cordray for giving us all the inside
听着，非常感谢亚伦·舒尔和兰迪·科德雷为我们提供了这一集的所有内幕

